These tests were generated with diy7, converted to the isla format with [1]
and then to the archsem format with ArchSem-rocq.

```
diy7 \
  -arch AArch64 \
  -num false \
  -type uint64_t \
  -nprocs 2 \
  -size 5 \
  -safe Pos**,Pod**,Rfe,Coe,Fre,DMB.SYd**
```

[1] https://github.com/rems-project/herdtools7-litmus-translator
